---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Writing
description: Writing by Jian on software engineering, reliability, and data.
permalink: /writing/
---
<section class="hero">
  <h1 class="page-title">Writing</h1>
  <p class="lede">Engineering notes, a little teaching, and the occasional experiment. Newest first.</p>
</section>

<p class="atlas-legend">
  <span><b>{{ collections.posts | length }}</b> entries</span>
  <span>newest first</span>
  <span>magnitude = reading time</span>
</p>

<section class="post-list">
  {% for post in collections.posts %}
  <a class="post-card" href="{{ post.url }}" style="--mag: {{ post.data.readingTime or 5 }}; --mag-tint: {% if post.data.readingTime >= 8 %}var(--accent){% elif post.data.readingTime >= 6 %}var(--star-cool){% else %}var(--star-faint){% endif %}">
    <span class="post-meta">{{ post.date | dateFormat }}{% if post.data.readingTime %}<br>{{ post.data.readingTime }} min{% endif %}</span>
    <div>
    <h2>{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
      <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
    </div>
  </a>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
